#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0022 expect=noViolation domain=CM
#note "No start-point column exists (None satisfied), so the sister RUNS - but neither branch of the union trigger holds on any row: row 1 CMOCCUR='N', row 2 a populated CMSTAT (FDA-SD0022 branch false), and no end timepoint is populated anywhere (FDA-SD0031 branch false). R-4.11c containment: neither parent would fire on this dataset either."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS label="Concomitant Medications"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col CMSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col CMTRT   type=Char label="Reported Name of Drug, Med, or Therapy"
col CMOCCUR type=Char label="CM Occurrence"
col CMSTAT  type=Char label="Completion Status"
col CMENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time of Medication"
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN   | N |          |
S1 | CM | 001 | 2 | IBUPROFEN |   | NOT DONE |
